{"defects_recorded":["decision_log.jsonl:seq 9 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 121 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 122 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 123 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 124 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 125 has no timestamp","claims_ledger.jsonl:seq 126 has no timestamp"],"detail":"Wake 4 hand-wrote ledger records without a timestamp. The records are genuine and hash-valid, but the reader required the field, so the ledger refused to parse them and wakes 5 and 6 aborted at preflight. Cause is the harness offering no validated way to append: every decision record so far was hand-written. Fixed by treating an incomplete-but-valid record as a recorded defect, by verifying records as written rather than as reconstructed, and by giving the agent the harness's own append code as secre-record.","hash":"46cf7599ea0a6db526b79fce9747f514b07f4ba3495f311aa915ab08dca50f90","kind":"incident","operator_fault":true,"phase":"postflight","prev_hash":"80e99724f8b6588e66204b82fb47af7441ef73b5854c03acbd069b31e4127d09","seq":21,"severity":"high","ts":"2026-08-21T06:37:02Z","wake":4,"wakes_lost":2}
